- `scripts/check_bundle.sh` — writable-copy P5-6 half with `-I -m venv` and `-I -c "import email, json, tempfile, ssl"`, no `-B` (F3); P5-9 whole-token PATH + `PYTHON[A-Z]*=` + SKIP (F7); P5-4 cert checks before the network, exit 2/3/4 verdicts (F11).
